{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir visual novel set in 1950s New York. Infiltrate a prison, build a smuggling network, and shape fates through tough choices across branching paths.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching choices &amp; multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison infiltration &amp; contraband network</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1950s New York noir atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequence-driven relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2D noir visuals</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now to stay updated for launch!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/25c42751562dce369dc8f8ab6a34c9e5.poster.avif?t=1768918902\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/25c42751562dce369dc8f8ab6a34c9e5.webm?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/25c42751562dce369dc8f8ab6a34c9e5.mp4?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In post-war America, the mafia no longer hides in the shadows - it rules the streets, the banks, and the politicians. The families control the avenues, the banks serve their interests, and the politicians are their toys. Yet even among your own, there is Omert\u00e0 - the code of silence that can never be broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/1ec8b67c477f9de3cbe71f4833898a2b.poster.avif?t=1768918902\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/1ec8b67c477f9de3cbe71f4833898a2b.webm?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/1ec8b67c477f9de3cbe71f4833898a2b.mp4?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alessandro Ver\u00ed, a man whose life now belongs entirely to the clan. To prove your loyalty, you are given a mission: infiltrate one of the most dangerous prisons in the country and establish a smuggling network from within. But behind bars, there are no simple rules - only endless intrigues and a brutal struggle for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day here is a conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every glance - a test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every word can save you... or bury you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide whom to swear loyalty to, whom to betray, whom to break, and whom to spare. The fates of those around you are at stake. Their blood, their secrets, their lives - all rest in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/3b53bb9e1eab96d4ffa4a35c88fdc464.poster.avif?t=1768918902\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/3b53bb9e1eab96d4ffa4a35c88fdc464.webm?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/3b53bb9e1eab96d4ffa4a35c88fdc464.mp4?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this story:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Darkness &amp; Neon - 1950s New York, cigarette smoke, whispers behind closed doors, and the cold gleam of a straight razor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Code of Honor - family demands loyalty... but never forgives mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Conspiracies &amp; Betrayals - every deal is dangerous, and every broken promise carries a deadly price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fates Intertwined - every choice changes not only your path, but the lives... and deaths... of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Price of Silence - in the shadow of Omert\u00e0, there are no \u201cright\u201d decisions. There is only survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are no winners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who learn to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and those who disappear without a trace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3982430?t=1768918902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/4a4dae824b95f6b865111c482a0f081e670be24f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768918902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/7de87ed9e5c5608085b890c0f9514df53bee3af4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768918902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/7de87ed9e5c5608085b890c0f9514df53bee3af4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768918902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Our game contains elements of violence and crime, consistent with the noir mafia setting of the 1950s.\r\nThe storyline includes murders, death threats, betrayal, corruption, prison life, and the organization of drug smuggling.\r\nThe game features morally challenging choices and themes related to the mafia, power, and the struggle for survival.\r\n\r\nThere are no scenes of sexual violence or sexual acts in the game.\r\nThere may be references to alcohol and drugs as part of the criminal atmosphere and historical context."},"demos":[{"appid":4046110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir visual novel set in 1950s New York. Infiltrate a prison, build a smuggling network, and shape fates through tough choices across branching paths.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching choices &amp; multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison infiltration &amp; contraband network</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1950s New York noir atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consequence-driven relationships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 2D noir visuals</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist now to stay updated for launch!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/25c42751562dce369dc8f8ab6a34c9e5.poster.avif?t=1768918902\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/25c42751562dce369dc8f8ab6a34c9e5.webm?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/25c42751562dce369dc8f8ab6a34c9e5.mp4?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In post-war America, the mafia no longer hides in the shadows - it rules the streets, the banks, and the politicians. The families control the avenues, the banks serve their interests, and the politicians are their toys. Yet even among your own, there is Omert\u00e0 - the code of silence that can never be broken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/1ec8b67c477f9de3cbe71f4833898a2b.poster.avif?t=1768918902\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/1ec8b67c477f9de3cbe71f4833898a2b.webm?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/1ec8b67c477f9de3cbe71f4833898a2b.mp4?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alessandro Ver\u00ed, a man whose life now belongs entirely to the clan. To prove your loyalty, you are given a mission: infiltrate one of the most dangerous prisons in the country and establish a smuggling network from within. But behind bars, there are no simple rules - only endless intrigues and a brutal struggle for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day here is a conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every glance - a test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every word can save you... or bury you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide whom to swear loyalty to, whom to betray, whom to break, and whom to spare. The fates of those around you are at stake. Their blood, their secrets, their lives - all rest in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/3b53bb9e1eab96d4ffa4a35c88fdc464.poster.avif?t=1768918902\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/3b53bb9e1eab96d4ffa4a35c88fdc464.webm?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/extras/3b53bb9e1eab96d4ffa4a35c88fdc464.mp4?t=1768918902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this story:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Darkness &amp; Neon - 1950s New York, cigarette smoke, whispers behind closed doors, and the cold gleam of a straight razor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Code of Honor - family demands loyalty... but never forgives mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Conspiracies &amp; Betrayals - every deal is dangerous, and every broken promise carries a deadly price.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Fates Intertwined - every choice changes not only your path, but the lives... and deaths... of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The Price of Silence - in the shadow of Omert\u00e0, there are no \u201cright\u201d decisions. There is only survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are no winners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who learn to survive...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and those who disappear without a trace.</p>","developers":["Bizi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982430/874b7beb144ee037e8d25740b780bf0343f07256/header.jpg?t=1768918902","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"